    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπρο-ΐημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send away forward, send on,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνα] ἀποπροέηκε πόλινδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταίρους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					1216
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>send forth, shoot forth,</i>
			
